{"3971290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Money Pit", "steam_appid": 3971290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> The Money Pit is currently played by inviting friends directly. There is no public lobby browser or matchmaking yet it's coming in an Early Access update soon. You'll need a group to play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOT FASTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/extras/a23eb16d3328b03e1b91e6b7733d567b.poster.avif?t=1786825154\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/extras/a23eb16d3328b03e1b91e6b7733d567b.webm?t=1786825154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/extras/a23eb16d3328b03e1b91e6b7733d567b.mp4?t=1786825154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time is money, and money is survival.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through <strong>deadly arenas </strong>to find the most valuable treasures before your rivals grab them first. Every second counts when you're competing against desperate slimes who want to live just as badly as you do.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STEAL IF YOU CAN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why work hard when you can work smart?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambush other contestants, steal their hard-earned loot, and watch their hopes crumble. In this twisted game show, there's no honor among slimes only winners and losers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/extras/d896a576504cb12bb1e439d63df850ad.poster.avif?t=1786825154\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/extras/d896a576504cb12bb1e439d63df850ad.webm?t=1786825154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/extras/d896a576504cb12bb1e439d63df850ad.mp4?t=1786825154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Flavor of Chaos:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SOLDIER: </strong>The toxic tactician. Lob poison smoke grenades that choke and blind anyone caught in the cloud. You don't chase the fight, you gas it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE THIEF:</strong> The greedy opportunist. Armed with a knife for up-close kills and a knack for raiding rival zones, pocketing 25% more cash from every score that isn't yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE TRAPPER:</strong> The patient hunter. Plant claymore mines and let the careless walk into them, while your trained eye spots any traps lurking nearby. You don't chase enemies you let them come to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE COWARD:</strong> The fast survivor. Run faster by default and shove enemies to the ground to escape danger. You may not be brave, but you’re still alive.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DON'T DIE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/extras/f80fbb99bbbb89bcdf4c3dd298bd4729.poster.avif?t=1786825154\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/extras/f80fbb99bbbb89bcdf4c3dd298bd4729.webm?t=1786825154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/extras/f80fbb99bbbb89bcdf4c3dd298bd4729.mp4?t=1786825154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danger lurks in every shadow, and one wrong move means you're tonight's entertainment.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the <strong>Center Zone</strong> opens, the loot gets better and monsters join the hunt. Stay alert, hide when you need to, and remember: only the slime with the most deposited cash gets to see their family again. Everyone else becomes part of the show.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> The Money Pit is currently played by inviting friends directly. There is no public lobby browser or matchmaking yet it's coming in an Early Access update soon. You'll need a group to play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOT FASTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/extras/a23eb16d3328b03e1b91e6b7733d567b.poster.avif?t=1786825154\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/extras/a23eb16d3328b03e1b91e6b7733d567b.webm?t=1786825154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/extras/a23eb16d3328b03e1b91e6b7733d567b.mp4?t=1786825154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time is money, and money is survival.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through <strong>deadly arenas </strong>to find the most valuable treasures before your rivals grab them first. Every second counts when you're competing against desperate slimes who want to live just as badly as you do.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STEAL IF YOU CAN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why work hard when you can work smart?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambush other contestants, steal their hard-earned loot, and watch their hopes crumble. In this twisted game show, there's no honor among slimes only winners and losers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/extras/d896a576504cb12bb1e439d63df850ad.poster.avif?t=1786825154\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/extras/d896a576504cb12bb1e439d63df850ad.webm?t=1786825154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/extras/d896a576504cb12bb1e439d63df850ad.mp4?t=1786825154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Flavor of Chaos:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SOLDIER: </strong>The toxic tactician. Lob poison smoke grenades that choke and blind anyone caught in the cloud. You don't chase the fight, you gas it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE THIEF:</strong> The greedy opportunist. Armed with a knife for up-close kills and a knack for raiding rival zones, pocketing 25% more cash from every score that isn't yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE TRAPPER:</strong> The patient hunter. Plant claymore mines and let the careless walk into them, while your trained eye spots any traps lurking nearby. You don't chase enemies you let them come to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE COWARD:</strong> The fast survivor. Run faster by default and shove enemies to the ground to escape danger. You may not be brave, but you’re still alive.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DON'T DIE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/extras/f80fbb99bbbb89bcdf4c3dd298bd4729.poster.avif?t=1786825154\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/extras/f80fbb99bbbb89bcdf4c3dd298bd4729.webm?t=1786825154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/extras/f80fbb99bbbb89bcdf4c3dd298bd4729.mp4?t=1786825154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danger lurks in every shadow, and one wrong move means you're tonight's entertainment.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the <strong>Center Zone</strong> opens, the loot gets better and monsters join the hunt. Stay alert, hide when you need to, and remember: only the slime with the most deposited cash gets to see their family again. Everyone else becomes part of the show.</p>", "short_description": "Try to survive a twisted TV show where you collect treasures, steal from other contestants, and deposit your loot before monsters or rivals take you down. Only the richest slime lives to see another day.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/f1d84d5d1d8971d9aa3188fc2bc20d139b8c43b0/header.jpg?t=1786825154", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/080fd7ac310d2cb2d93a9c744afa0e704bacebcb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786825154", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971290/080fd7ac310d2cb2d93a9c744afa0e704bacebcb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786825154", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>